LongSpeak.Content:
当$t\in[0,\varepsilon]$时, 有$v(t)=v_0(t)$, 而当$t>\varepsilon$时, 有
$$\begin{align}
    v(t-\varepsilon )&=v_0\left( t-\varepsilon -\left[ \frac{t-\varepsilon}{\varepsilon} \right] \varepsilon \right) \left( 1-\int_{\left[ 0,\varepsilon \right]}{v_0\left( \tau \right) \mathrm{d}\tau} \right) ^{\left[ \frac{t-\varepsilon}{\varepsilon} \right]}
    \\
    &=v_0\left( t-\left[ \frac{t}{\varepsilon} \right] \varepsilon \right) \left( 1-\int_{\left[ 0,\varepsilon \right]}{v_0\left( \tau \right) \mathrm{d}\tau} \right) ^{\left[ \frac{t}{\varepsilon} \right] -1}
    \\
    &=\frac{1}{1-\int_{\left[ 0,\varepsilon \right]}{v_0\left( \tau \right) \mathrm{d}\tau}}v\left( t \right). 
\end{align}$$
